p-server` to `\"scope\": \"worktree\"` in `.mcpx.json`, now that its dependencies have landed: #958 (PR #3925, `ResolvedScope` plumbing + spawn cwd) and #959 (initialize `rootUri`/`workspaceFolders`).\n- This is the deliberate last slice named in `pkgs/mcpx/docs/decisions/0004-scope-resolved-roots.md` (\"the config flip is deliberately the last slice\").\n\n## On #864 (absolute paths)\n\n#864 covers the `codedb` and `fff` entries, which carry `/home/user/...` paths. The `gopls-mcp-server` entry has no absolute paths (`go run golang.org/x/tools/gopls@latest mcp`), so the post-#864 config shape does not block this flip, and the flip does not pre-empt #864.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `.mcpx.json` parses; `gopls-mcp-server` resolves to `{command, args, mcpx:{scope:\"worktree\"}}`.\n- `cd pkgs/mcpx && go test ./internal/config/ -run 'Scope|Extras|Parse' -count=1` → ok.\n\n## Remaining acceptance (live proof, owed)\n\nThis PR lands the config flip. The live proof from #961 still needs a machine with a running mcpx daemon and Go toolchain, and is being tracked by the queue task rather than asserted here:\n\n1. `go_package_api` on a module path returns the real API promptly (not empty),\n2. the same proof from a linked worktree is rooted in that worktree,\n3. two callers in different checkouts show distinct gopls instances in `mcpx status`.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796820806&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=8049&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F8049&signature=9ed992ed4e68972b6c3ee363fd61ba97f31282e6447ca27d83b396eb41e11516\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmi